{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:62621b9d145ab65869f23e9bb57f550462086ae761445d226460d2e57dfd87fe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d61e8c887bdf48fab03a73c1f7e313ef34961c0a3c3a31a7299c4729bdd71db8",
      "text": "喂。之前拍的那个蒸汽什么的海报，\n已经贴出来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9e63ab541c26fb31d67eac86f531e5c54be58648a4398cdc336c979a0c29454",
      "text": "靠照片来展现本大爷最强绝世大天才的魅力，\n倒也不算坏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214d301f303e88f4af6da6e317065b9cdad9db0f3d487f204696288bea8217fa",
      "text": "是一张很帅气的海报呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9a8c461e3ceab83736c36c60662f1b10304aec471373c6f92d4ec97540adc03",
      "text": "啊……？搞什么啊，仔细一看\n贴在隔壁墙上的，根本不是本大爷啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1919819ab2f3ca596e4ed1a01a5044b7fdbdcc1bb1275d6f2c08b7f61d49a6e9",
      "text": "啧，真无聊。我记得这个游乐项目，\n是个乱枪扫射的玩意儿来着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35bae0f3a6434eb163b895bf3d43b893087c4fcc2698d15033f737d3da8cbea2",
      "text": "枪法明明是本大爷最强的。\n想搞宣传的话有本大爷一个人就足够了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb24dee34ccb442b746feb6a05575a09af3a657598ecafefba390a058f01b27",
      "text": "是非常适合涟先生的设定呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6de366159ed979ce43da7ec0d02c1f4724da1d3ba67ae219500e9f1ae63246e",
      "text": "玩枪的动作很有架势哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42944c551ce44c1c6d7989b49e34678300db61a8c279398f5e0757e9685dc74f",
      "text": "哈，那可是只有本大爷才演得了的角色。\n给他们好好见识了一番强大啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be25dd62e9c519a19291924aa4c7e53df2cf490a8c2f6792112afb67fa06e687",
      "text": "虽然以本大爷的实力根本不需要武器就是了！\n不过大肆拿枪战斗的感觉，也还不赖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efff4e88b021c62ddb6aa94e167780b04cfbfc07e5e5442c5b73f161ae6150ef",
      "text": "别的那些家伙，\n拧发条、看怀表的，也太土气了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a5e961b42d01c3b8a2b6e64bbcbb76218c20ae249a382dd2c7b5f7d600c141",
      "text": "哼，趁那些家伙磨磨蹭蹭的工夫，本大爷疯狂开枪，\n抢尽了风头！咕哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:040ren_303_2_3_040_03_09_a:2_3_040_03_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5c019f33c32f63c8f660a3fa790d490f13d9b01ce89dbe0a85ba0cf71c7aca8",
      "text": "果然本大爷才是最强的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
